    "section": "07. The Battle Round",
    "ruleNumber": "07.03",
    "summary": "To close the battle round, resolve its triggered rules in this order:\n\n1. Rules other than mission rules.\n2. Mission aspects either player has achieved that trigger now.\n\nUnless the battle is over, the next round then begins; the mission sets how many rounds are played.",
